Description:
 system-upgrade - native update notifier for KDE Plasma
Changes:
 system-upgrade (2.0.0) resolute; urgency=medium
 .
   * Reimplement the update notifier in C++ with Qt 6 and KDE Frameworks 6.
   * Replace privileged shell scripts and APT output parsing with PackageKitQt6.
   * Add Plasma notifications, a StatusNotifierItem and single-instance support.
   * Rebuild the Debian source package and add automated tests.
